  "releaseNotes": "v2.9.0: Complete HTTP request/response body logging support. Added RequestTracingModule for ASPX pages with operate field extraction. TraceContextHandler refactored to async/await with full body capture. Automatic Content-Type, Content-Length tracking. Test coverage: 9 Web API endpoints, ASPX page tracing. Production-ready for .NET Framework 4.8 Web applications.",
